  "text": "BluePearl Frederick | Frederick, MD | Pet Urgent Care\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Frederick, MD\nBluePearl\nUrgent Care\nFrederick, MD\n(formerly VetUrgency)\nReserve arrival time\n301.288.8387\n434 Prospect Blvd\nFrederick, MD 21701\n[email protected]\nUrgent care:\nMon-Tue: 6 pm-12 am\nWed: Closed\nThurs-Fri: 6 pm-12 am\nSat & Sun: 12 pm-12 am\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nReserve Arrival Time\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nReserve Arrival Time\nBluePearl Urgent Care.\nServing the greater Frederick area\nBluePearl Frederick, formerly known as VetUrgency, provides urgent care for sick and injured pets throughout the communities surrounding Frederick County, Maryland, including Frederick, Hagerstown, Mt. Airy, Westminster, Hancock, Cumberland and Emmittsburg MD; Gettysburg, Hanover and Chambersburg PA; Leesburg, Sterling, Middleburg and Winchester VA; Harpes Ferry, Berkeley Springs and Martinsburg WV and beyond.\nYou can find us in the Weis Festival Shopping Center off of Jefferson Street, east of I-270, north of I-70 and along the 340/15 corridor.\nOur services.\nTrusted urgent care for pets. When it matters most.\nWhen your pet needs immediate attention for a non-life-threatening illness or injury and cannot wait for a regular appointment, our team provides immediate evaluation and treatment for symptoms such as:\nVomiting, diarrhea or stomach upset\nNot eating or drinking\nUrinary concerns (blood in urine)\nFractures and broken bones\nLimping or signs of pain\nFever or decreased energy (lethargy)\nMinor wounds\nEar, eye or skin conditions\nPersistent coughing or sneezing\nTorn or broken toenail\nPossible toxin ingestion (please call ahead)\nEnd-of-life care (hospice and palliative)\nUrgent care vs. emergency\nIf you aren't sure where to go, use our \"\nIs this a pet emergency?\n\" guide or give us a call. We're happy to help guide you.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nOur teams are dedicated to advancing veterinary medicine while honoring the human–animal bond and supporting the pets who are part of your family.\nMeet our Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Frederick urgent care.\nAt BluePearl Frederick (formerly VetUrgency), our experienced veterinarians provide compassionate care when pets are sick or injured.\nWith on-site digital radiology, ultrasound and diagnostic laboratory services, our team can quickly assess your pet’s condition and begin treatment so they can get back to feeling their best.\nAt BluePearl, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions before or after your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our caring and knowledgeable hospital team at\n301.288.VETS\n(8387) or\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n301.288.8387\n434 Prospect Blvd\nFrederick,\nMD                                    21701\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nSkylos Sports Medicine\nFredrick, MD\n434 Prospect Blvd\nFrederick, MD 21701\n410.465.2428\n0.14 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nRockville, MD\n1 Taft Ct.\nRockville, MD 20850\n301.637.3228\n26.69 miles\nSkylos Sports Medicine\nWoodstock, MD\n10829 Birmingham Way\nWoodstock, MD 21163\n410.465.2428\n29.46 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
